# The build context of the panel image (src/Game.Admin/Dockerfile): everything is left out, then only what the panel needs is let back in.
# BuildKit reads this file instead of the root .dockerignore (the server image's) for this Dockerfile.
**

!global.json
!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Packages.props
!.editorconfig
!src/Game.Shared/**
!src/Game.Content/**
!src/Game.Admin/**
!content/**
content/client-content.reference.json

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/*.md
**/*.pfx
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.env
**/appsettings.Development.local.json
